> but is it possible to make them "tame" on food alone, or do you need
> charm monster/taming magic?

To further elaborate what everyone said:

Cats and Dogs (and kittens and little dogs and all of them) can be
tamed with any meat OR human food (not tins).  So, you can use candy
bars, half eaten rations, full rations, fortune cookies, or the freshly
killed goblin corpse right in front of you.  I've thrown a corpse at
them to tame'em a couple of times *laugh*

Horses (and ponies and warhorses) can only be tamed by vegetable food.
This includes lichen corpses, shrieker corpses, or any edible
vegetarian corpses (freshly killed, except lichen corpses will always
be fresh to eat).  

